/* 答题页：对齐「进入下一个页面/最后刷题页面」HTML（设计宽 480px，按 750/480≈1.5625 换算，整体放大一档） */

page { background: #F1F7FF; }

.status-pad { width: 100%; background: #FFFFFF; }

.q-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100vh;
  background: #F1F7FF;
  color: #20354F;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
}

/* ---------- 顶栏 ---------- */
.nav-row {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}
.q-back { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #526B84; font-size: 24rpx; }
/* 标题相对整屏居中，左右留出等宽安全区，避免压到退出按钮和微信胶囊 */
.q-heading {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 200rpx;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.q-heading-title {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: #20354F;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.q-heading-sub { display: block; margin-top: 5rpx; color: #74879D; font-size: 19rpx; }

/* 答题卡 / 收藏：缩小后放在题目来源行最右侧 */
.q-card-actions { flex: 0 0 auto; margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 10rpx; }
.q-icon {
  width: 54rpx;
  height: 54rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE9F3;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #F8FBFE;
  color: #8395A8;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1;
}
.q-icon-on { border-color: #E6BD68; background: #FFF4DF; color: #BC842D; }

.q-bar { height: 6rpx; background: #E5EDF5; }
.q-bar-fill { height: 100%; background: #28AE85; border-radius: 0 6rpx 6rpx 0; transition: width .2s; }

/* ---------- 内容 ---------- */
.q-scroll { flex: 1; min-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
.q-meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin: 26rpx 28rpx 16rpx;
}
.q-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10rpx; }
.chip {
  padding: 8rpx 13rpx;
  border-radius: 11rpx;
  background: #DCEEFF;
  color: #3975A9;
  font-size: 19rpx;
  line-height: normal;
}
.chip-type { background: #E8E2FF; color: #725AA7; }
.chip-mode { background: #E5F6E9; color: #43825C; }
.q-chapter { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #74879D; font-size: 19rpx; }

.q-card {
  margin: 0 24rpx;
  padding: 30rpx 26rpx 26rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0EAF3;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 6rpx 22rpx rgba(70, 104, 135, .07);
}
.q-source-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14rpx; }
.q-source { flex: 1; min-width: 0; color: #7C8EA2; font-size: 19rpx; line-height: 1.5; }
.q-stem { display: block; margin: 18rpx 0 0; color: #1C3149; font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-word; }
.stem-image { display: block; width: 100%; margin: 14rpx 0; border-radius: 12rpx; }

.options { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 28rpx; }
.option {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 18rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 17rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
}
.option-key {
  flex: 0 0 44rpx;
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #EDF1F5;
  color: #718196;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.option-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; color: #40566E; font-size: 25rpx; line-height: 1.55; word-break: break-word; }
.option-selected { border-color: #4AB184; background: #F0FBF6; }
.option-selected .option-key { background: #27B479; color: #FFFFFF; }
.option-selected .option-text { color: #246E54; }
.option-correct { border-color: #4AB184; background: #E7F7EF; }
.option-correct .option-key { background: #27B479; color: #FFFFFF; }
.option-wrong { border-color: #E8ADB3; background: #FFF0F1; }
.option-wrong .option-key { background: #D46872; color: #FFFFFF; }

.answer-area { margin-top: 26rpx; }
.answer-input {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 180rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 22rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #FBFCFF;
  color: #20354F;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  line-height: 1.7;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.answer-box { margin-top: 20rpx; padding: 20rpx 22rpx; border-radius: 16rpx; background: #EAF7EF; }
.answer-caption { display: block; color: #287B5D; font-size: 21rpx; font-weight: 700; }
.answer-text { display: block; margin-top: 8rpx; color: #33574A; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 1.7; }

.feedback { margin-top: 24rpx; padding: 20rpx 22rpx; border-radius: 16rpx; }
.feedback-good { background: #E7F7EF; color: #287B5D; }
.feedback-bad { background: #FFF0F1; color: #A84C59; }
.feedback-title { display: block; font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 750; }
.feedback-text { display: block; margin-top: 6rpx; font-size: 21rpx; line-height: 1.7; }

.self-mark { display: flex; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 20rpx; }
.self-btn {
  flex: 1;
  height: 76rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  color: #476078;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.self-btn-on { border-color: #4AB184; background: #F0FBF6; color: #246E54; }
.self-note { display: block; margin-top: 12rpx; color: #5E7A93; font-size: 21rpx; }

/* ---------- 折叠区 ---------- */
.details { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14rpx; margin-top: 26rpx; }
.detail-row { border: 2rpx solid #DFE9F3; border-radius: 16rpx; background: #F9FBFD; overflow: hidden; }
.detail-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 20rpx;
}
.detail-title { color: #397F6C; font-size: 23rpx; font-weight: 650; }
.detail-hint { color: #7C8EA2; font-size: 19rpx; }
.detail-arrow { color: #7C8EA2; font-size: 19rpx; }
.detail-body { padding: 0 20rpx 20rpx; color: #687D93; font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.75; }
.detail-empty { color: #98A6B5; font-size: 21rpx; }
.detail-static { padding: 20rpx; }
.detail-source { display: block; margin-top: 8rpx; color: #687D93; font-size: 20rpx; line-height: 1.7; }

.q-bottom-space { height: 150rpx; }

/* ---------- 底部操作 ---------- */
.q-bottom {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 14rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 24rpx calc(16rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border-top: 2rpx solid #E4EDF6;
}
.q-nav {
  flex: 1;
  height: 84rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  color: #50677F;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.q-nav-off { opacity: .45; }
.q-submit {
  flex: 1.3;
  height: 84rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #247FEE;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.q-submit-done { background: #9EC4EE; }
.tap-dim { opacity: .72; }

/* ---------- 底部弹层 ---------- */
.sheet-mask {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 30;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  background: rgba(28, 44, 64, .42);
}
.sheet {
  width: 100%;
  max-height: 76vh;
  overflow: auto;
  padding: 26rpx 24rpx calc(30rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-radius: 28rpx 28rpx 0 0;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.sheet-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16rpx; }
.sheet-title { color: #20354F; font-size: 30rpx; font-weight: 750; }
.sheet-close { padding: 0 10rpx; color: #7B8BA0; font-size: 40rpx; line-height: 1; }
.sheet-hint { display: block; margin: 10rpx 0 20rpx; color: #7B8BA0; font-size: 19rpx; }

.card-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14rpx; }
.card-cell {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  height: 76rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0E6ED;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  color: #314760;
  font-size: 23rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.card-cell-done { border-color: #B7DECE; background: #E8F5EE; color: #28775B; }
.card-cell-wrong { border-color: #EDC7CA; background: #FBEFEF; color: #AD525C; }
.card-cell-on { border-color: #247FEE; background: #EAF4FF; color: #1B6FA8; }

/* ---------- 默写板 ---------- */
.board-sheet {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 26rpx 24rpx calc(24rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-radius: 28rpx 28rpx 0 0;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.board-title-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.board-sub { margin-top: 4rpx; color: #7B8BA0; font-size: 19rpx; }
.board-canvas {
  width: 100%;
  height: 520rpx;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #E0EAF3;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.board-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12rpx; margin-top: 20rpx; }
.board-tool {
  padding: 10rpx 20rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
  color: #476078;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  line-height: normal;
}
.board-tool-on { border-color: #247FEE; background: #EAF4FF; color: #1B6FA8; font-weight: 700; }
.board-colors { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10rpx; margin-left: auto; }
.board-color { width: 34rpx; height: 34rpx; border-radius: 50%; border: 4rpx solid transparent; }
.board-color-on { border-color: #247FEE; }
.board-sizes { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 18rpx; }
.board-size {
  width: 64rpx;
  height: 58rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2rpx solid #DFE7EF;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #F8FAFC;
}
.board-size-on { border-color: #247FEE; background: #EAF4FF; }
.dot { border-radius: 50%; background: #20354F; }
.dot-s { width: 8rpx; height: 8rpx; }
.dot-m { width: 14rpx; height: 14rpx; }
.dot-l { width: 20rpx; height: 20rpx; }
.board-save {
  margin-left: auto;
  padding: 14rpx 44rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #247FEE;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.q-empty { padding: 160rpx 40rpx; color: #7B8BA0; font-size: 24rpx; text-align: center; }
